{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["^「恐怕衹能出此下策……」","#","^speaker:??? ","/#","#","^portrait:wushi ","/#","#","^layout:layout2 ","/#","#","^audio:default","/#","\n","^「那我全部吞掉了。」","\n","^「等等，好像有人的氣息！住手——」","\n","^「哎呦！」","#","^speaker:鄔詩 ","/#","#","^portrait:wushi ","/#","#","^layout:layout1","/#","\n","^「到底是誰在……」","\n","^？","#","^speaker:??? ","/#","#","^portrait:god-1 ","/#","#","^layout:layout2","/#","\n","^？？","#","^speaker:鄔詩 ","/#","#","^portrait:god-1 ","/#","#","^layout:layout1","/#","\n","^「居然有<b><color=#FAFF24>人類靈媒</color>在，動作真快。」","#","^speaker:白 ","/#","#","^portrait:god-1","/#","\n","^「唉……差一點釀成大錯，果然直接吞噬的風險還是太大了。」","#","^speaker:黑 ","/#","#","^portrait:god-1 ","/#","#","^layout:layout1","/#","\n","^「嘿，凭我的反應速度不會有事的。應該要把她趕出去，再試一次。」","#","^speaker:白 ","/#","#","^portrait:god-2","/#","\n","^「不能再冒險了，這樣<b><color=#FF2424>太容易波及現實世界</color>……」","#","^speaker:黑 ","/#","#","^portrait:god-1","/#","\n","^「喂。」","#","^speaker:鄔詩 ","/#","#","^portrait:wushi","/#","\n","^「？」","#","^speaker:白、黑 ","/#","#","^portrait:god-1","/#","\n","^「你們是什麼東西啊，這異常空間是你們搞出來的嗎？」","#","^speaker:鄔詩 ","/#","#","^portrait:wushi","/#","\n","^「老實說…」","#","^speaker:白、黑 ","/#","#","^portrait:god-1","/#","\n","^「老夫不記得了」","#","^speaker:黑 ","/#","#","^portrait:god-1","/#","\n","^「我不記得了」","#","^speaker:白 ","/#","#","^portrait:god-2","/#","\n","^「蛤啊？」","#","^speaker:鄔詩 ","/#","#","^portrait:wushi","/#","\n","^「別擔心，小姑娘。雖然事態還不太明朗...」","#","^speaker:黑 ","/#","#","^portrait:god-1","/#","\n","^「但老夫現在有了些 <b><color=#FAFF24>新的想法</color>。」","#","^speaker:黑 ","/#","#","^portrait:god-1","/#","\n","end",["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"#f":1}],"listDefs":{}}